      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DROP A STACK (3) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 23.21. Draws to advantage and has a good record over this journey. The form out of her last race has been franked. Hard to go past. PRIMAL BOOST (7) comes off a (25.55) win last time, scoring by 1.3 lengths in a Grade 4/5 over 450m at Grafton. Has two wins already from this draw. Suited here and expected to run well. KEYS A KRACKEN (1) won by a space two back then gave a start but got home into the frame when second at this track (23.47) last time. Expected to be in the finish again. GARY INDIANA (2) found the frame for the second consecutive time when narrowly beaten into second last time out (22.92) over 400m at this track.",
